# React Native Best Practices

When writing or refactoring React Native/Expo code in this project, follow the guidelines in **.agents/react-native-skills/AGENTS.md**. Use **.agents/react-native-skills/SKILL.md** as a quick reference. For detailed incorrect/correct examples and explanations, read the full AGENTS.md.

## Priority summary

| Priority | Category         | Impact   |
| -------- | ---------------- | -------- |
| 1        | List Performance | CRITICAL |
| 2        | Animation        | HIGH     |
| 3        | Navigation       | HIGH     |
| 4        | UI Patterns      | HIGH     |
| 5        | State Management | MEDIUM   |
| 6        | Rendering        | MEDIUM   |
| 7        | Monorepo         | MEDIUM   |
| 8        | Configuration    | LOW      |

Key rules: virtualize lists (FlashList), memoize list items, avoid inline objects in renderItem, animate only transform/opacity, use native navigators, use Pressable over TouchableOpacity, wrap strings in Text, avoid `{value &&}` when value can be 0 or "".
